{"id":"77b50faea085ff34","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-gandy-basis.md","title":"二进制树的超算术路径推论：名称订正","display":"thm-gandy-basis — 二进制树的超算术路径推论：名称订正","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-gandy-basis","aliases":["20-thm-gandy-basis"],"display":"thm-gandy-basis — 二进制树的超算术路径推论：名称订正","chapter":"8","section":"8.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"verified-finite-fragment","source_reference":"Theorem 8.5.1(ii)；补充 HYP 定义的有限层情形","source_pdf_pages":[202],"source_printed_pages":[169],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-effective-compactness]]","[[20-df-hyp]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-gandy-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-gandy-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gandy-basis — 二进制树的超算术路径推论：名称订正"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"verified-finite-fragment"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 8.5.1(ii)；补充 HYP 定义的有限层情形"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>202</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d387a906642794f7\" href=\"?note=d387a906642794f7\" title=\"20-df-hyp\">20-df-hyp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为可计算树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\\ne\\varnothing\">\\([T]\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d387a906642794f7\" href=\"?note=d387a906642794f7\" title=\"20-df-hyp\">20-df-hyp</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HYP}=\\{A:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ A\\le_TH_a\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HYP}=\\{A:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ A\\le_TH_a\\}\\)</span> 是上游 hyp 中的自然数集合族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land \\operatorname{set}(X)\\in\\mathrm{HYP}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land \\operatorname{set}(X)\\in\\mathrm{HYP}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有效紧致性先给出 0′ 可计算路径。记号 2 是 1 的后继，H_2=∅′，故此路径按 HYP 定义属于 HYP。该二进制树结论是 Kreisel 路径基的推论，并非真正涉及相对 CK 序数的 Gandy Basis Theorem。保留旧文件名但改正标题与来源；完整 Gandy 定理另待新建。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.5.1(ii)；补充 HYP 定义的有限层情形；印刷页 169；PDF 第 202 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-effective-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"49047c938f7aef20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-effective-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyp","status":"resolved","id":"d387a906642794f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-effective-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"49047c938f7aef20","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-hyp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyp","status":"resolved","id":"d387a906642794f7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-hyp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"[T]\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HYP}=\\{A:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ A\\le_TH_a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [X\\le_T\\varnothing'\\land \\operatorname{set}(X)\\in\\mathrm{HYP}].","display":true}],"bytes":1560,"backlinks":[{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-gandy-basis]]"},{"id":"4011ec29b6dff303","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-gandy-basis]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-466","locations":[